     "type": "text",
     "text": "Possibly. California treats some out-of-state students differently, but you're not here as a student; you moved to work full time. Living and working in SF generally makes you a resident for DMV purposes. If unsure, the DMV site has a residency definition, and when in doubt registering is the safer side.",
